      "contract": "Rust external reads include the CLI recursive tools registry scan, the CLI GH-508 channel-id and capability-literal scan of every crate source tree, the generated docs_search corpus and its reviewed source inventory, security docs assertions, and crate-local reports. The native public_fs/project.rs composition reader consumes the public API index through the existing bundle owner and is registered before its feature source lands. Reader-source drift invalidates this recorded scope. Agents still run full format, clippy and workspace tests before completion; ordinary invocation routing selects these gates only when relevant. documentation_inputs are read only as text by keld-cli: docs_search embeds llms-full.txt behind keld_cli::mcp, which no reverse dependent calls (keld-host tests use keld_cli::boot, create and dev only), and the registry and doctor tests are keld-cli's own. A diff whose only matching paths are documentation_inputs therefore selects keld-cli without Cargo reverse dependents (#624). A reverse dependent that starts reading one of these documents, or calling keld_cli::mcp, must move that document into inputs in the same change.",
